    "detailed_description": "Home Deco Puzzles brings you the joy of building miniature interiors mixed into a relaxing puzzle game. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099050/extras/0cb007ffa55df843e3903bb533b0142c.webp?t=1674749540\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEMORIZE</h2><br>Try to memorize where each item has its position by its surroundings or the differences of similiar looking items.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099050/extras/efa1a0f319c4245b4581d5de1dbf876e.webp?t=1674749540\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNPACK</h2>After a short amount of time all items are put into boxes and ready to be unboxed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099050/extras/110333f430ca04e0b5b344b86daaa12d.webp?t=1674749540\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DECORATE</h2>Now decorate the room with the items and put each item back to its originally position! <br><br>A room will be shown and after a short amount of time packed into boxes. Try to memorize the items position by its surroundings or differences of similiar looking items. Now you have to unpack the whole room and place each item back to his originally position with the mouse. However, to complete a room you do not need to put all items back at the right position. Unbox and decorate four different room types starting with small single rooms, double rooms, penthouse rooms and big Studio rooms. The peaceful soundtrack completes the game into a meditative puzzle experience.<br><br>Can you unpack the room and place each item back to his originally position ?<br>It is Simple, relaxing and fun for everyone!<br><br>Features :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four different room sizes<br></li><li>A variety of different rooms like small and big Living Rooms, Lofts and Coffee shops and more (currently 60 Rooms)<br></li><li>Combination of different mechanics to help you to complete a room (memorization, puzzle elements)<br></li><li>Relaxing game experience</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Home Deco Puzzles brings you the joy of building miniature interiors mixed into a relaxing puzzle game. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099050/extras/0cb007ffa55df843e3903bb533b0142c.webp?t=1674749540\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEMORIZE</h2><br>Try to memorize where each item has its position by its surroundings or the differences of similiar looking items.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099050/extras/efa1a0f319c4245b4581d5de1dbf876e.webp?t=1674749540\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNPACK</h2>After a short amount of time all items are put into boxes and ready to be unboxed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2099050/extras/110333f430ca04e0b5b344b86daaa12d.webp?t=1674749540\" /></div> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DECORATE</h2>Now decorate the room with the items and put each item back to its originally position! <br><br>A room will be shown and after a short amount of time packed into boxes. Try to memorize the items position by its surroundings or differences of similiar looking items. Now you have to unpack the whole room and place each item back to his originally position with the mouse. However, to complete a room you do not need to put all items back at the right position. Unbox and decorate four different room types starting with small single rooms, double rooms, penthouse rooms and big Studio rooms. The peaceful soundtrack completes the game into a meditative puzzle experience.<br><br>Can you unpack the room and place each item back to his originally position ?<br>It is Simple, relaxing and fun for everyone!<br><br>Features :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four different room sizes<br></li><li>A variety of different rooms like small and big Living Rooms, Lofts and Coffee shops and more (currently 60 Rooms)<br></li><li>Combination of different mechanics to help you to complete a room (memorization, puzzle elements)<br></li><li>Relaxing game experience</li></ul>",
